title ADLC Harness Steerer

participant Engineer
participant "ADLC Plugin\nClaude/Codex/Auggie" as Plugin
participant "steer-adlc-harness.py" as Conductor
participant "Target Repo" as Repo
participant ".adlc Harness" as Harness
participant ".adlc Plan" as Plan
participant "Standards Checker" as Checker
participant "Tests and Tools" as Tools
participant "Proof Artifacts" as Proof

Engineer->Plugin: Request feature, bug fix, unit tests, or remediation
Plugin->Conductor: Start task with task_type and optional source_report
Conductor->Repo: Discover existing harness and repo signals
Repo-->Conductor: Files, tests, reports, current conventions

alt No harness exists
  Conductor->Harness: Initialize shared ADLC state
  Harness->Repo: Write .adlc files only by default
else Harness exists
  Conductor->Harness: Refresh shared state without overwriting user work
end

Conductor->Repo: Detect existing .claude/.codex/.augment/Superpowers harnesses
Repo-->Conductor: Existing local harness references
Conductor->Harness: Record detected harnesses
note over Plugin,Repo: Repo-local platform files are optional overrides only

alt fix-project-codeguard-findings
  Conductor->Repo: Read reports/project-codeguard-security.json
  Conductor->Harness: Set remediation task and source report
else Feature, bugfix, unit-test, or orchestration
  Conductor->Harness: Classify task and select blueprint
end

Conductor->Harness: Create task blueprint
Harness->Plan: Write canonical .adlc/plans/<run>/ artifacts
Plan->Plan: Add tests, evals, standards checks, work items
Plugin->Tools: Run focused failing or baseline checks
Tools-->Plugin: Failure output or baseline evidence
Plugin->Repo: Implement one work item
Plugin->Tools: Run validation commands
Tools-->Plugin: Test, lint, coverage, or build result

alt Validation fails
  Plugin->Harness: Append status and failure context
  Plugin->Repo: Repair bounded work item
  Plugin->Tools: Re-run validation
else Validation passes
  Plugin->Checker: Run ADLC standards profile
  Checker-->Plugin: Standards report
  Plugin->Proof: Write proof of functionality
  Plugin->Harness: Update status and handoff
end

Plugin-->Engineer: Summarize outcome, evidence, and next action
